# SnoreClient

SnoreClient is a fork of Equicord (which forks Vencord). Keep upstream attribution: existing file headers stay as they are and new source files use the `Vencord, a Discord client mod` SPDX header.

## Layout

- `src/plugins` plugins inherited from Vencord, `src/snoreclientplugins` plugins inherited from Equicord. Aliases `@plugins/*` and `@snoreclientplugins/*`.
- `server/` self hosted cloud sync + website. Plain Node 22 ESM, no dependencies, tests in `server/test`.
- Build time constant `SNORE_SERVER_URL` (from env `SNORECLIENT_SERVER_URL`) is the server a build points at. Use it instead of hard coding hostnames.

## Checks

`pnpm testTsc`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm lint-styles`, `pnpm lint:patches`, `pnpm build`. For the server: `cd server && npm test`.
The build needs a git commit, or `SNORECLIENT_HASH` and `SNORECLIENT_REMOTE` set.

## Style

- Smallest diff that solves the problem. No refactors unless asked. No comments unless asked.
- TypeScript `strict`. No `any`, no `@ts-ignore`, no non-null `!`, no `enum`, no `../../` where an alias exists.
- Reuse components from `@components/*` and `@webpack/common` before writing new ones.
- Settings UI styling goes through `src/components/settings/snore-theme.css`; the accent is `--snore-accent`.
